      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-26T22:39:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>the front for the wraith and haka arn't correct either since they are copies of the kickstarter image and they changed them since. I think haka is only semantics but wraith changed from 2 damage to 1 target to 1 damage to 2 targets</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>as far as I know the new promo's arn't on bgg yet(only kickstarter images of front sofar). I would use spiff's things because they are great but i'd rather stick to the unedited format because I have those for the old promo's. But I think it's just waiting for someone who wants &nbsp;to scan them in. Get permission from &gt;games folks and post them.&nbsp;</p>",
