    {
      "id": 56661,
      "name": "Katsue",
      "username": "Katsue",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-27T00:13:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Wuischke\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/ba8739/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Wuischke:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>the front for the wraith and haka arn't correct either since they are copies of the kickstarter image and they changed them since. I think haka is only semantics</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It is indeed only semantics in the sense that the meaning of the power's text has changed. You no longer have to discard a \"haka\" card when using the Power.</p>",
      "post_number": 9,
